  "body": "Last one selling below market value - be quick!  \r\n\r\nDiscover the perfect blend of comfort and functionality in this near-new modern 1-bedroom apartment (65m² more or less) with a generous study that easily accommodates a double bed. Ideal for investors, small families, retirees, or roommates, this space offers a cosy yet versatile living arrangement. \r\n\r\n* $13,000 worth of chattels and extra value included:  Fridge, Dishwasher, washer/dryer, central ventilation system, security alarm, block-out blinds, block-out curtain and a Clearguard security screen\r\n* Separate laundry\r\n* Double glazing \r\n* Ventilation system\r\n* Lock-up and leave convenience\r\n* Halo Builders guarantee\r\n\r\nDo you have a busy lifestyle, are you seeking a relaxed living environment without the hassle of maintenance, then this is for you! \r\n\r\nPrime location with easy walking distance to services, amenities, schools, and public transport. And only a short drive to variety of stunning beaches, parks, and reserves. \r\nFive sold - only one left. Get in before it's gone. \r\n\r\nIt's vacant with immediate possession available PLUS all the furniture is for sale (brand new, used for staging) - just move in and enjoy!",
